{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28e79b9794fe1251a497b12a975dfc6244c64bbc489a6e47211421fca203032c", "ja": "（美奈子の初仕事は、宣材写真の撮影だ。\n準備に時間がかかってるけど、どうしたんだろう？）", "zh": "（美奈子的第一件工作是拍摄宣传照。\n她准备时花了一些时间，是怎么了呢？）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1001_019min", "source_sha256": "3f50f3638797f7fc85e043d3f4610e22775edd780685a6bbee2b3f2329555cba", "ja": "あの～～、\n{$P$}さ～ん……。", "zh": "那个～～\n{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1002_p", "source_sha256": "3014b0c1a1918f25a786aaeb8c1b51a19c3e6eba0454a3ed4b3ad282aee1f5c1", "ja": "おっ、ウワサをすれば……。\n美奈子、準備終わったんだな！", "zh": "哦，才刚想到人就出现了……\n美奈子，你做好准备了吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "ad64ff8bb74cc0da31f83f8b56db08939c138e9dff8b08af725158113f8b7331", "ja": "…はい！\n……でも、あの。えっと……。", "zh": "……是的！\n……可是，那个，呃……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1004_p", "source_sha256": "547df017f17cd7036dc3e7d50cabdd454f5c7f18aa5e9e8ee12b1fb60e9660c0", "ja": "？　どうしたんだ、美奈子。\n何か困ってるのか？", "zh": "嗯？怎么啦，美奈子。\n有什么伤脑筋的事吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1005_019min", "source_sha256": "cb47ddb5e9e51b5cbee7bfc249fb711d1aa5777e3ebfe63d9a03d43e79adf172", "ja": "こ、困ってるっていえば、困ってるんですけど。\nその～……。", "zh": "要、要说伤脑筋的话，的确是伤脑筋啦。\n那个……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1006_019min", "source_sha256": "e12143e2ce7233a914ba1ed9c4ef1ee6f357876a28c5297d171292b62537a41a", "ja": "……{$P$}さん。\n私、ヘンじゃないですか……？", "zh": "……{$P$}先生，\n我会不会很奇怪啊……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8b0b7f83a3a8792e9110f43ca5249fe9afa59986b8fb187fa66172d6612d5b51", "ja": "別に、どこもヘンじゃないと思うけど……\nどうかしたのか？", "zh": "我不觉得有哪里奇怪啊……\n怎么了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "5b8119aa4fe138605dec490d17b6a877f2183f388b0579916eb3e65c57e70868", "ja": "実は……撮影のために、メイクさんに\n髪やメイクを整えてもらったんです。", "zh": "其实是……为了拍照，\n我请化妆师帮我打理了妆发造型。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1009_019min", "source_sha256": "77fbbccf4e0c1c3002d3aa009f0e0485cc969d7f1be36e9c301f3870d6315b01", "ja": "私、人のお世話をするのは好きなんですけど！\n自分がされるのには、慣れてなくって……。", "zh": "虽然我喜欢照顾人！\n但不习惯自己被人照顾……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "46991ecf231829a4f925258d2036bc9845d7c3bec85bd93149f2dd42e980b498", "ja": "あ、イヤってわけじゃないんです！　ただ\n落ち着かなくて、そわそわしちゃうんですよ～。", "zh": "啊，也不是讨厌的意思！\n只是有点静不下心来，坐立不安的～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1011_p", "source_sha256": "9439710b7627cbd2879c23521670bc145b2ecfaa03bfd52d130683d01b0fa605", "ja": "はは、なんだ。そういうことか。", "zh": "哈哈，什么嘛，原来是这么回事啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1012_019min", "source_sha256": "67d58c56bd8144c0302c2d9e27531b7710ceca1fd59e818bbe13a14118064ab5", "ja": "それに、いつもとなんとなく雰囲気が違うから、\n似合ってるのかどうか自分じゃわからなくって……。", "zh": "而且，氛围好像也和平常不太一样，\n我自己感觉不出来这样到底适不适合……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1013_p", "source_sha256": "c18a5bd724e517e93449684a4153698b0d5b004c2865645190e10d507f964c01", "ja": "大丈夫だ。ちっとも変じゃないし、似合ってる。\nちゃんと可愛いよ！", "zh": "放心，一点都不奇怪，很适合你。\n你这样很可爱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1014_019min", "source_sha256": "41b354cfa157cb18692f60826cea6e62a2f62485e8de04992f9f7f2f8609fb43", "ja": "ええっ！？　か、可愛いだなんて……。\nもう、そんなことありませんよ～！！", "zh": "咦咦！？居、居然说可爱……\n真是的，没那回事啦～！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1015_p", "source_sha256": "ada54d5c2a18ae5ea62fa84e0947c4fdf303c1528e4c55252ec2d88c533aef23", "ja": "おいおい。\nこれから美奈子は、アイドルとして活動するんだろ？", "zh": "喂喂，\n美奈子今后是要以偶像身分来活动吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1016_p", "source_sha256": "bbdb5a1af950595fd10a8f9c4a91582ce4a5eac481bb950dbbdc63fd8e9a2d6b", "ja": "アイドルなら可愛くするのは当然だし、\nプロの人のメイクも、慣れてもらわないとな。", "zh": "既然是偶像，那打扮得可爱也很理所当然，\n你要习惯让专业的人化妆。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1017_019min", "source_sha256": "9ae72e8a3c1c8f4727e68bb167d7f74070fbb3791b0281a6da8469b86f8c068c", "ja": "う、う～ん……。\n……それもそうですね！　わかりました！", "zh": "唔、唔……\n……说得也是！我知道了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1018_019min", "source_sha256": "f3dbb86042586ef9dffab97e035b45e72d0902965ba6b1849a174e8cc07231dc", "ja": "なんだか初めてのことばっかりだから、\n思ったより緊張しちゃってたのかも……えへへ。", "zh": "大概因为很多事都是第一次体验，\n所以我似乎比想像中还紧张……嘿嘿。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "41890a8caabd5b6757fd268e5662db66bc2ed2886cd6b87516e47ce98f7f120b", "ja": "{$P$}さん♪\n私、目いっぱい頑張ってきますね！", "zh": "{$P$}先生♪\n我会尽全力加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1020_p", "source_sha256": "40fadd5a0298ab86b0e3a380081d16a71bc15184204f4211e4afc2d757ae1135", "ja": "（その後の撮影で、美奈子はカメラマンさんの\n指示通り、しっかりと自分をアピールしてみせた）", "zh": "（之后的拍摄过程中，美奈子按照摄影师的指示，\n好好地表现了自己的魅力。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "fd3eda16621f4e32008cb20e530f00fc14d74f9e3b93f49b9504347f7f9c9e58", "ja": "{$P$}さん、お疲れさまです！\n撮影、緊張したけど、楽しかったです！", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你辛苦了！\n虽然拍照时很紧张，但我拍得很开心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1022_019min", "source_sha256": "5639e360abe34c231f161b1d1694fc786a779e24c110389926a559349e578bb1", "ja": "撮った写真を見せてもらったんですけど、\nすっごくステキで……私じゃないみたいでした♪", "zh": "我看了拍出来的照片，\n拍得好漂亮……差点认不出是自己呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1023_p", "source_sha256": "14abc7afe5e8aa207f661e3f067b6bc37e5fb0d3fbf47576b946b1c6ef31a850", "ja": "いい写真を撮ってもらえてよかった。\nでも……まだ、実物の方が上かな？", "zh": "能拍出好照片真是太好了。\n不过……还是本尊比较漂亮吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1024_019min", "source_sha256": "7c991ebac6fb010bf51d03a96d4fd1c2dc0aeb25e50674afea7bccebcf54a95e", "ja": "も、もうっ。{$P$}さんってば、\n褒めるのが上手ですね～？", "zh": "真、真是的。{$P$}先生，\n你很会称赞人耶～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1025_019min", "source_sha256": "3149ae98a52fc05db47da3efbddb3cf464ca791fc0d49d96d17e71ab6481defe", "ja": "そんなに嬉しいこと言われると、\n私、調子に乗っちゃいますからね～？", "zh": "你这样夸我，\n我会得意忘形的喔～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1026_p", "source_sha256": "6432e501f31cf00ef6493dee9e99be0c683d6a8be38dbf3547c9d3e28a049ca4", "ja": "え？　いや、本当のことなんだけどな……。", "zh": "咦？不，我说的是实话啊……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1027_p", "source_sha256": "7b4674f89937f5b20146d779e9190d5f01f25e868e894f8fca78cf22164cab0e", "ja": "（でも、このアイドルらしからぬ謙虚なところも、\n美奈子の魅力のひとつなのかもしれないな）", "zh": "（不过，这种不像偶像作风的谦虚态度，\n可能也是美奈子的魅力之一吧。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1028_019min", "source_sha256": "47962353cda32589992a4977119badc206998105caf7de07882d541c7039aa1e", "ja": "この写真で、私を宣伝して……\nアイドルのお仕事をもらうんですよね？", "zh": "你会用这张照片帮我宣传……\n并替我接偶像的工作对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1029_019min", "source_sha256": "e2c230e288c41a7bffa85299a5de752582a9941404d3a84afccf58738d1c4125", "ja": "みんなに見てもらえるお仕事が、\nいっぱいできるといいな～。楽しみですっ♪", "zh": "真希望可以接到很多能被大家看见的工作～\n我好期待♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "memory_019min_002_jp.gtx", "item_key": "memory_019min_002_1030_p", "source_sha256": "6890b64c2845e89c8b863cf091693c8e9eeb32b128d92a437dd873fa2b546a6b", "ja": "（みんなに見てもらえる、か。\n美奈子の夢は、きっと、すぐにでも叶うだろう）", "zh": "（能被大家看见是吗……\n美奈子的梦想一定很快就会实现的。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
